  "text": "The NIIP is a national-scale indemnity program that integrates a central asset registry with government hazard data, aiming for a hybrid indemnity-parametric structure. It targets expansion to hospital buildings and equipment and addresses barriers in specialist capacity and international market access. The program is supported by a formal collaboration framework with SEADRIF and involves data integration between NARS and GeoRiskPH for improved risk analytics.",
